{"version":1,"key":"quest:27","content":{"id":27,"title":"React 为什么要自定义合成事件？","summary":"React 为什么要自定义合成事件： 跨浏览器的兼容 抹平不同浏览器事件名称，事件属性，监听方式上的差异，开发者仅需关心 React 提供的一直的事件接口，而无需关注浏览器底层的差异 性能提升...","target":{"key":"quest:27","type":"quest","id":27},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[{"id":1445,"createTime":1745406820844,"updateTime":1745406820844,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"React 为什么要自定义合成事件："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"跨浏览器的兼容"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抹平不同浏览器事件名称，事件属性，监听方式上的差异，开发者仅需关心 React 提供的一直的事件接口，而无需关注浏览器底层的差异"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"性能提升"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过事件委托的机制，React 仅在根元素上面对各事件进行监听，而无需在每一个 DOM 上都绑定事件，减少了内存的消耗"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"更好的灵活性"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Portal","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这样组件的存在，可以将组件挂在任意的 DOM 下面去，如果使用原生事件，则无法在组件层级上实现阻止冒泡和捕获，而由 React 事件系统模拟的冒泡和捕获则可以轻易的实现"}]}]}]}],"source":{"type":"custom","contentId":1445,"published":false}}],"materials":[],"trail":[{"time":1744701675345,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1745406820844,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下解答","refs":[]},{"time":1745406820844,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1744701675345,"updateTime":1745406820844,"resolvedTime":1745406820844},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1745406820844}}